source Library</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">More guides, articles, and tactical content.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157320,"order":2,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157321,"order":3,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; padding: 28px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; letter-spacing: .2px;\">\n      These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. These products are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. Information on this site is provided for informational purposes only and is not intended as a substitute for advice from your physician or other health care professional.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"child_css":{},"css":{},"id":216207157322,"order":4,"styles":{},"type":"rich_text"}]}},"widgets":{}}